<BaseLayout title="Partner With Us | House of Agape" description="Bring a House of Agape wellness experience to your community or organization.">
  <section class="page-hero section-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Partner with us</p><h1>Bring care into your community.</h1><p class="lede">House of Agape is building partnerships with community organizations, ministries, and groups that want to create meaningful spaces for renewal and connection.</p></section>
  <section class="section-shell partner-grid"><article><span class="card-number">01</span><h2>Host a workshop</h2><p>Invite House of Agape to facilitate a thoughtful wellness, self-care, or encouragement-focused gathering for your group.</p></article><article><span class="card-number">02</span><h2>Create an experience together</h2><p>Co-create a retreat, program, or community event that makes people feel welcomed, supported, and restored.</p></article><article><span class="card-number">03</span><h2>Support the vision</h2><p>Connect around sponsorships, in-kind support, venue collaboration, or future community programming.</p></article></section>
  <section class="quote-band compact"><p>Partnership details and inquiries will be available here soon.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
